==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{m|non|aldr}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{m|gem-pro|*aldrą}}, whence also Old English {{m|ang|ealdor}}, Old High German {{m|goh|altar}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{m|ine-pro|*al-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*h₂el-||to grow}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈaltʊɹ]|lang=fo}}
*: {{rhymes|altʊɹ|lang=fo}}

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|m|aldurs|aldrar}}

# [[age]]
# age, [[seniority]]
# [[time]], [[era]]

====Declension====
{{fo-decl-noun-m19|ald|r}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|fo|ævi}}, {{l|fo|æviskeið}}, {{l|fo|lívstíð}}
* {{l|fo|elli}}, {{l|fo|aldurdómur}}
* {{l|fo|tíð}}, {{l|fo|tíðarskeið}}

===Anagrams===
* {{l|fo|dalur}}

